{"snapshot": {"page_id": "s0-distribution", "stage": "content", "attempt_ns": 1795504229537492000, "prepared_ns": 1795504229584419000, "checks": {"content": "8ecdcadd078c93a7579679d87bb9fbe2470c84b32c9d5675acabebfb01e89cb0"}, "panels": [1, 2, 3, 4], "page": {"id": "s0-distribution", "title": "평활근과 혈류 배분", "source_topic_sha256": "e58ee24a3449e7b7019c70178cbded0ffb0ebccd02e7c5db1b0d7b5688350f22", "status": "ready", "question": "모세혈관에 근육이 없는데 그쪽 혈류는 어떻게 조절할까?", "source_dependencies": {"topics": [], "files": ["복습노트/1124/.assets/figures_1124/fig-s0-distribution.svg", "복습노트/1124/.assets/figures_1124/fig-s0-distribution-site.svg"]}, "summary": {"text": "세동맥의 벽과 모세혈관 입구에 있는 근육이 수축하면 통로가 좁아져 혈류가 줄어요. 이완하면 통로가 넓어져 혈류가 늘어요.", "evidence": ["s0-distribution:e004", "s0-distribution:e005", "s0-distribution:e006", "s0-distribution:e007", "s0-distribution:e008", "s0-distribution:e009", "s0-distribution:e010", "s0-distribution:e011", "s0-distribution:e012", "s0-distribution:e013", "s0-distribution:e014", "s0-distribution:e015", "s0-distribution:e017", "s0-distribution:e019", "s0-distribution:e020", "s0-distribution:e021", "s0-distribution:e022", "s0-distribution:e023", "s0-distribution:e024", "s0-distribution:e025", "s0-distribution:e026"]}, "terms": [{"term": "모세혈관 괄약근", "text": "모세혈관이 시작되는 곳에서 입구를 조이거나 풀어 혈류를 조절해요.", "evidence": ["s0-distribution:e005", "s0-distribution:e009", "s0-distribution:e013", "s0-distribution:e019", "s0-distribution:e020", "s0-distribution:e021", "s0-distribution:e022", "s0-distribution:e023", "s0-distribution:e024", "s0-distribution:e025", "s0-distribution:e026"]}], "panels": [{"style_reference": "flat-objects", "scene": "Two same-length hoses in parallel in the lower image. Upper one pinched in the middle by a rounded clamp, emits a small jet. Lower hose unpinched emits a wider jet. Same inlet hose diameters, obvious same source, no lettering.", "alt": "같은 물통에서 물이 나오는 호스 두 개 중 조인 호스의 물줄기가 더 약하다.", "caption": "같은 공급 조건에서 통로가 좁아지면 흐르는 양이 줄어요.", "characters": [], "dialogue": [{"speaker": "student", "text": "수축하면 밀어서 피가 더 세게 나가는 거 아니에요?"}, {"speaker": "guide", "text": "여기서는 통로가 좁아지는 일이 중요해요. 같은 조건이면 조인 호스로 물이 적게 가요."}], "evidence": ["s0-distribution:e001", "s0-distribution:e017", "s0-distribution:e019", "s0-distribution:e020", "s0-distribution:e021", "s0-distribution:e022", "s0-distribution:e023", "s0-distribution:e024", "s0-distribution:e025", "s0-distribution:e026", "s0-distribution:e042", "s0-distribution:e043"]}, {"style_reference": "flat-structure", "scene": "A rust-red thick-walled arterial feeding vessel lies horizontally on the bottom of the frame, flowing LEFT to RIGHT. At its right end, the passage visibly BRANCHES into THREE SEPARATE very thin pale-pink capillaries; all three branch lumens are visible in parallel going right for a long length. EACH branch has its own small round golden ring wrapped around JUST THAT BRANCH at the beginning. Exactly three small rings, one around each pale pink branch; do not place enlarged rings where the common rust-red conduit ends. Long rust-red feed vessel to left has continuous smooth muscle wall separately indicated with several broad red bands. No muscles along the long portions of the capillaries.", "alt": "세동맥 벽의 연속된 근육과 모세혈관 입구의 근육 고리, 그 뒤의 얇은 모세혈관.", "caption": "세동맥은 소동맥, 평활근은 민무늬근으로도 나와요.", "characters": [], "dialogue": [{"speaker": "student", "text": "그 근육은 모세혈관 벽에 둘려 있어요?"}, {"speaker": "guide", "text": "세동맥 벽에는 평활근이 있어요. 모세혈관은 입구의 괄약근까지만 보고, 그 뒤의 가는 벽에는 근육이 없어요."}], "evidence": ["s0-distribution:e004", "s0-distribution:e005", "s0-distribution:e006", "s0-distribution:e007", "s0-distribution:e008", "s0-distribution:e009", "s0-distribution:e010", "s0-distribution:e012", "s0-distribution:e013", "s0-distribution:e014", "s0-distribution:e016", "s0-distribution:e030", "s0-distribution:e031", "s0-distribution:e032"], "art_references": [{"kind": "structure", "path": "tmp/bio-review-comic/1124-1795503326/art-input/s0-distribution-site.png"}]}, {"style_reference": "flat-process", "scene": "Two separate side-by-side matched simplified capillary diagrams. In each, a rust red arteriole runs straight from left to right and ends with an arrow still on the straight path. ONE separate narrow pale-pink capillary branches downward diagonally off that arteriole in a clearly visible T- or Y-junction. Place ONE mustard cuff around the PALE PINK BRANCH ALONE, a short distance beyond its branch point: no cuff on the horizontal red common vessel. In LEFT diagram the cuff is narrow but a very small passage remains, with a thin downward arrow. In RIGHT diagram the cuff and branch mouth are relaxed and wide, with a thicker downward arrow. The width and position of each arteriole remain equal; use smaller diagram scale and leave completely blank top.", "alt": "왼쪽의 좁게 조인 입구와 오른쪽의 이완한 입구를 비교한다.", "caption": "평활근은 의식적으로 움직일 수 없고 자율신경의 영향을 받아요. 두 장면에서는 근육 상태가 달라져요.", "characters": [], "dialogue": [{"speaker": "student", "text": "입구의 괄약근이 이완하면요?"}, {"speaker": "guide", "text": "통로가 넓어지고 그쪽에 혈액이 더 많이 흘러요."}], "evidence": ["s0-distribution:e015", "s0-distribution:e017", "s0-distribution:e019", "s0-distribution:e020", "s0-distribution:e021", "s0-distribution:e022", "s0-distribution:e023", "s0-distribution:e024", "s0-distribution:e025", "s0-distribution:e026", "s0-distribution:e033", "s0-distribution:e034", "s0-distribution:e035", "s0-distribution:e036", "s0-distribution:e037", "s0-distribution:e038", "s0-distribution:e039", "s0-distribution:e040", "s0-distribution:e041"], "art_references": [{"kind": "structure", "path": "tmp/bio-review-comic/1124-1795503326/art-input/s0-distribution-site.png"}]}, {"style_reference": "flat-process", "scene": "Side-by-side diagrams in the lower area. Left shows simplified hand and wrist with subtle highlighted muscles in the palm, showing a thick supply arrow entering those hand muscles. Right shows stomach and upper intestine with thick supply artery arrow. Clear separate contexts, no people, no text.", "alt": "손을 쓰는 상황에는 손 근육, 